## Installation
Quick copyable commands for getting started locally.

Example (Python):
```bash
git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>.git
cd <repo>
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Example (Node):
```bash
git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>.git
cd <repo>
npm install
npm run build
```

